{%- comment -%}
  Outputs "y" when a product ships on its own delivery rate and so does NOT count towards the
  £500 free-delivery threshold, otherwise "n". Mirrors the shipping profiles in Shopify
  (Settings > Shipping and delivery), Sep 2026:
    Towel Rads        Heated towel rails, free
    Bathroom Products shower sets and bath shower mixers, free
    Showers TP        vendor "TP - Showers", free
    Kart Taps         vendor "Kartell" (taps, showers, accessories, basins), free
    LED mirror/Lumora LED mirrors (mirrors template), £5.99
    Sample profiles   samples, free or £2.99
  Everything else (tiles, adhesive, grout, boards, radiators, toilets, vanities...) is in the
  General profile: £39.99 under £500, free from £500.
  If a product is moved between shipping profiles, update the rules here too.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign tod = 'n'
  assign tod_type = product.type | downcase
  assign tod_title = product.title | downcase
  if tod_type contains 'towel rail' or tod_type contains 'shower set' or tod_type contains 'bath shower mixer'
    assign tod = 'y'
  elsif product.vendor == 'Kartell' or product.vendor == 'TP - Showers'
    assign tod = 'y'
  elsif product.template_suffix == 'mirrors-v2' or product.template_suffix == 'mirrors' or product.template_suffix == 'led-mirrors'
    assign tod = 'y'
  elsif product.tags contains 'Samples' or tod_type contains 'sample' or tod_title contains '[free sample]'
    assign tod = 'y'
  endif
  echo tod
-%}